  "statement": "A chat filter flags messages that read the same forwards and backwards.\n\nGiven `text`, return `True` if it is a palindrome when you **only look at letters** and **ignore case**. Digits, spaces and punctuation are skipped. A message with no letters counts as a palindrome.",
